{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028117001:0":{"text":"휴윈, 라이카 기억하지? 황혼의 순찰자가 됐대! 브라이언도 방랑자의 일원이 되었고.","source_cn":"伊温，你还记得莱卡吗？她成为薄暮巡游者了！布莱恩也加入...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD19762AF4F18CC54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028117002:0":{"text":"라이카 언니랑 브라이언 오빠가? 둘 다 정말 멋지다...","source_cn":"莱卡姐姐和布莱恩大哥吗？他们都好棒啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CEF7845A8D98E9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028117003:0":{"text":"로잔도! 아든 님이 로잔을 학생으로 받아들이셨대. 두 사람 중 누가 더 골치 아플지 모르겠어. 로잔은 규칙을 잘 안 지키니까.","source_cn":"还有洛桑，雅顿大人收了他当学生，虽然不知道更头疼的会是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD756658F810A4568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028117004:0":{"text":"글쎄 로잔이 틈만 나면 숲 밖으로 뛰쳐나가서 아든 님이 벌써 몇 번이나 잡아오셨다지 뭐야.","source_cn":"我听说呀，他做梦都想去丛林外闯荡，被雅顿大人揪着耳朵拎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD475D1A8802D2845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028117005:0":{"text":"숲 밖으로...","source_cn":"去丛林外……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B24B9AAF069A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028117006:0":{"text":"참, 휴윈, 숲 밖에 가보지 않을래?","source_cn":"对了，伊温，你想出去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE87EFFF33CA6C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028117007:0":{"text":"어? 숲 밖에?","source_cn":"诶，出去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0337FF6901F6530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028117008:0":{"text":"응. 바투소 산맥 너머 에스페리아의 다른 곳으로 가서 바다와 호수를 보고 오지 않을래?","source_cn":"嗯，去瓦度索山脉之外，伊索米亚的其他地方，去看看大海和湖泊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8E179D0EEC95C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028117009:0":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4B7C9EF853FF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028117010:0":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:回忆中的芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"回忆中的芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"sp